nked to media item','','none'),(7599,_binary 'Use local files for reusable media.','','none'),(7600,_binary 'Use local images for reusable media.','','10.5.6'),(7601,_binary 'Menu settings.','Validation','none'),(7602,_binary 'You can only change the menu settings for the <em>published</em> version of this content.','','none'),(7603,_binary 'To view a revision, you also need permission to view the content item.','','10.5.6'),(7604,_binary 'To revert a revision, you also need permission to edit the content item.','','10.5.6'),(7605,_binary 'To delete a revision, you also need permission to delete the content item.','','10.5.6'),(7606,_binary 'Path alias.','Validation','none'),(7607,_binary 'You can only change the URL alias for the <em>published</em> version of this content.','','none'),(7608,_binary 'REST support for content types (provided by the <a href=\":node\">Node</a> module) is enabled by default. To enable support for other content entity types, you can use a <a href=\":config\" target=\"blank\">process based on configuration editing</a> or the contributed <a href=\":restui\">REST UI module</a>.','','none'),(7609,_binary 'Limited date range','','none'),(7610,_binary 'Your PHP installation has a limited date range.','','none'),(7611,_binary 'You are running on a system where PHP is compiled or limited to using 32-bit integers. This will limit the range of dates and timestamps to the years 1901-2038. Read about the <a href=\":url\">limitations of 32-bit PHP</a>.','','none'),(7612,_binary 'A client error happened','','none'),(7613,_binary 'To run cron from outside the site, go to <a href=\":cron\" class=\"system-cron-settings__link\">@cron</a>','','none'),(7614,_binary 'Run times of individual cron jobs will be written to watchdog','','none'),(7615,_binary 'Delete temporary files after','','10.5.6'),(7616,_binary 'Temporary files are not referenced, but are in the file system and therefore may show up in administrative lists. <strong>Warning:</strong> If enable